window.products.push({"id":359056,"name":"ZEO-Sleep Memory Foam Pillow - Reversible Orthopedic Pillow Supports Neck, Head and Shoulders - Firm Pillow for Back, Stomach and Side Sleepers - Pill","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61imhelEiDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A BETTER NIGHT’S SLEEP STARTS TONIGHT - Find a great balance of softness and plump firmness in our ZEO-SLEEP neck pillow. It is an orthopedic pillow that is expertly created to ensure maximum comfort conventional pillows can’t provide. This memory foam pillow may help reduce your neck problems and help you get a good night’s sleep! REVERSIBLE DUAL SURFACE PILLOW TO FIT YOUR SLEEPING NEEDS - The ZEO-SLEEP memory foam pillow has a reversible dual-surface design that adapts to your personalized sleeping needs. With its contour side, side sleepers can enjoy a great neck support pillow, while its classic side gives maximum back support. These reversible pillows are designed to accommodate the specific curves of your body. ERGONOMIC BALANCED HEAD AND NECK SUPPORT PILLOW - This ergonomic neck pillow provides a low and high contour height which gives the personalized support needed to keep the neck in line. It offers gentle support and comfort for the head and neck. This orthopedic pillow for neck pain helps reduce and relieve shoulder stiffness and promotes deep and high-quality sleep. SOFT, COMFORTABLE, & KEEPS ITS SHAPE - Our pillow is encased in a soft 100% cotton cover that increases breathability and ventilation to provide a cooler sleeping experience. This reversible orthopedic pillow will never lose its ergonomic shape giving you a long-lasting quality sleep. It firmly supports your head, neck, and spine at the same time. This neck pillow provides a smooth finish and soft feel to ensure a comfortable night’s sleep. PILLOW CARE - CertiPUR US and OETX-TEX100 certified. All product materials are carefully selected, inspected, and well constructed to ensure that the bed pillows will hold up to daily use. Hand wash these pillows every 2 months, or spot clean them whenever necessary. Never put these memory foam pillows in the washing machine or dryer to avoid damage. Memory foam pillows should be replaced every 2 to 3 years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61imhelEiDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sinomax","source_asin":"B0C1TN6D89","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-359056","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1TN6D89","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1TN6D89","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
