window.products.push({"id":359197,"name":"Beegreen Christmas XX-Large Drawstring Laundry Hamper Camouflage 115L Laundry Bag, Collapsible Laundry Baskets with Handles, Dirty Clothes Hamper for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S3WINw45L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【115L XXLarge Capacity & Durable】: The extra large laundry basket measures 31.5'' x 17.5'' x 17.5'' with a capacity of 115L which have heavy-duty storage containers that are enough for holding 3 loads of laundry. Our laundry hamper is made of nylon that is lightweight yet quality, not easily deformed. All seams of the laundry bag are reinforced with webbing, and the handles use \"X\" reinforced stitching, you don't have to worry about the quality of the dirty clothes hamper. 【Stop Falling & Standing Effect】: The hampers for laundry with drawstring closure can stop the storage items from falling, and the sealed dirty clothes hamper is more privacy in the room. High-density polyester material and the sturdy metal frame embedded in the head of the clothes basket make the laundry basket can stand firmly upright, even if you don't put things inside, this laundry basket can keep standing. 【Humanized Design & Collapsible】: Compared with other laundry hampers, this 31.5 ' tall laundry basket makes you do not have to bend over when you use it.The drawstring closure can stop the storage items from falling. Two solid handles can facilitate you to drag your clothes hamper full of clothes. It is lightweight for pregnant women, seniors, and kids to easily carry even up and down stairs easily. The laundry bag can be easily folded up into a piece to save space when you do not use it. 【 Multi-Purpose & Multi Occasions】: Our dirty clothes hamper has a large capacity that is suitable for clothes, kids' toys, home textiles, pet products, sheets, pillows, towels, and so on. It can be used as a laundry basket dorm, baby and kids laundry hamper in laundry bin, bedroom, dormitory, utility room, and other places. This laundry bag can be folded to get the most use of every space, so it can also be used during travel and camping. 【Washing Tips】:The foldable laundry basket with PE coating keeps stored items dry and makes cleaning easy. So do not use the washer and dryer to wash the collapsable laundry basket, the PE coating might be damaged. When the clothes hamper is dirty, just wipe it with a wet towel or wash it with water, then air dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S3WINw45L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BeeGreen","source_asin":"B0B5GKJ2S7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-359197","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5GKJ2S7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5GKJ2S7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
