window.products.push({"id":359322,"name":"Organic Reusable Beeswax Food Wrap by Clever Changes - Assorted Of 3 Sizes - Washable - Eco Friendly - Natural Healthy and Biodegradable Wraps - Handm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1m7hR1WAPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Plastic cling wraps use harmful chemicals such as PVC and BPA. These chemicals have been linked to cause birth defects, skin diseases, cancer and deafness. Beeswax food wrap is made 100% from organic biodegradable ingredients without any harmful chemicals. Protect yourself, your family and the environment from harmful plastics with this trendy little Kitchenware. Click ADD TO CART now to start wrapping your food in style. WHAT IS BEESWAX? It’s a natural wax produced by honey bees. The bees wax paper wrap is hand made with 100% organic beeswax, cotton, jojoba oil and tree resin. It is a great natural alternative to aluminium and plastic cling wraps. WHY IS IT BETTER THAN ALUMINIUM OR PLASTIC WRAP? Works And Clings Better Works And Clings Better Washable And Reusable Washable And Reusable Keep Food Fresh For Longer Keep Food Fresh For Longer Free of BPA, PVC And Other Harmful Chemicals Free of BPA, PVC And Other Harmful Chemicals Bees wrap sustainable food storage is Zero Waste And Environmentally Friendly Bees wrap sustainable food storage is Zero Waste And Environmentally Friendly HOW LONG DOES BEESWAX WRAP LAST? It lasts for about a year or 120-150 uses if used correctly and rinsed in cold water only. Can be frozen for upto a month. It will melt if used with hot food or in microwave. WHAT ARE THE DIMENSIONS? Comes in a pack of 3 with 3 different sizes, 1 SMALL (6\" x 6\"), 1 MEDIUM (10\" x 10\"), 1 LARGE (12\" x 12\").  You're automatically covered by our 100% Money Back “Wrap Me Up” Guarantee, no questions asked. Click Add to Cart now to wrap your food in style today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1m7hR1WAPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Clever Changes","source_asin":"B07CT1Y1V2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-359322","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CT1Y1V2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CT1Y1V2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
