window.products.push({"id":359344,"name":"Modern City Style Fire Escape Decorative Shelf. Bring The City Vibe Into Your Home With This Easy to Install Wall Hanging Shelf. This Eye-Catching She","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KshvAbPYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Modern City Style Fire Escape Decorative Wall Shelf (Black)Package Includes: 3 Shelves 3 Ladders (2 diagonal ladders, 1 bottom straight ladder) 6 screws (2 screws each shelf) 6 wall anchorsTools required for proper installation: Screwdriver Measuring Tape PencilInstructions:1. Once you decide where to place or install the shelf, place the top shelf against the wall and markboth spots where the screws should be placed using a pencil. Make sure both marked spots arealigned using a measuring tape.2. Hold the top shelf against the wall and drill the screws (use wall anchors for firmer hold) on bothmarked spots until top shelf is tightly placed.3. Hang one of the ladders (with side handlebar) on the bottom right-hand side of the top shelf to laydiagonally between top and 2nd shelf. Place the 2nd shelf between 10-12 inches from the top shelf(top shelf base to 2nd shelf base) as desired.(If you would like to have more spacing between the shelves use the 12 inches measurement gapbetween the shelves. With this measurement 3rd ladder (without side handlebar) should hangvertically on the bottom 3rd shelf.With 10 inches gap between the shelves 3rd ladder can hang vertically on either the 2nd shelf or the3rd shelf (whichever you prefer).4. Place and secure the 2nd shelf by repeating step 1 and step 2.5. Hang one of the ladders (with side handlebar) on the bottom right-hand side of the 2nd shelf to laydiagonally. Make sure to follow the same set measurement used previously to make sure the shelflooks even overall.6. Place and secure the 3rd shelf by repeating step 1 and step 2.7. Hang the 3rd ladder (without side handlebar) on the left side of the 2nd or 3rd shelf vertically based onspacing used or your preference.We hope you enjoy your new unique Modern City Style Fire Escape Decorative","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KshvAbPYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MyMod Essentials","source_asin":"B08KRY5P29","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-359344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KRY5P29","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KRY5P29","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
