window.products.push({"id":359380,"name":"Kilner Twist Top Lid Pack D, Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CkSSS7NyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The original and the best, all other brands are substitutesThis pack of 6 Kilner Twist Top Lids fit perfectly with the Kilner Twist Top Bottles of 8.5 fl oz. The Kilner Twist Top Bottles are great additions to any kitchen and are perfect for serving condiments and storing cordials, sauces, and herb infused oils. These lids measure 1/4-Inch high and 2-Inches in diameter. 6 Lids per package.The original Kilner jar, first invented by John Kilner and Co in the 1840s in England, is as much-loved and successful now as it was 170 years ago. Its long-lasting popularity is owed to its unique pressure seal and iconic design. Put simply, households all over the world trust it to successfully preserve and pickle their fruit and vegetables. A surge in popularity for preserving home-grown fruit and vegetables has catapulted the Kilner jar into the limelight in recent times. Now, not only is the Kilner jar an essential for the kitchen, but has become a statement of style around the home and office. Made in England, Kilner has been successfully canning fruit & vegetables since 1842.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CkSSS7NyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kilner","source_asin":"B00C1TF55S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-359380","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00C1TF55S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00C1TF55S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
