window.products.push({"id":359406,"name":"FRALIMK Bathroom LED Mirror 24\" x 32\" Frameless Wall Mounted Vanity Mirror with Dimmable Lights Anti-Fog Makeup Mirror, Horizontally/Vertically Hangin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":117.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sL5u4hSES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DIMMABLE AND LIGHTING COLOR ADJUSTABLE LED MIRROR: The brightness of the lighted bathroom mirror can be adjusted from 15% to 100% of its lumen by long pressing the power button. And you can select 3,000K warm white, 4,000K neutral white light, or 6,000K daylight as you need by short pressing the power button. And the memory function will remember the status of your lighting settings when you cut the power. You don't have to reset the light mode when you reconnect the power ANTI-FOG SMART MIRROR WITH SEPERATE TOUCH SWITCH: This backlit wall mirror has an anti-fog function that can be ON/OFF according to your needs. Never worry about the mist or water drops to blur your makeup mirror. The separate anti-fog switch design makes this wall-mounted mirror much safer and energy-saving since the function can be ON/OFF no matter the led light is ON or NOT. Giving you a clear reflection mirror experience in the foggy bathroom SMART TOUCH SENSOR AND WALL SWITCH CONTROL: This bathroom mirror for vanity has 2 smart touch sensor controls, one for the lighting, one for anti-fog function. This led lighted bathroom mirror has a 5ft long power cable with a plug that supports hardwired and plug-in to a wall switch. Led light source creates bright, energy-efficient illumination, their long-lasting LED provides a lifetime of use (50,000 hours) SIMPLE, MODERN FRAMELESS MIRROR DESIGN: The frameless design of these led bathroom mirrors for wall fit in with a wide variety of interiors and the copper-free silver mirror offers a clear, clean reflection experience. Hanging simple, modern frameless wall mirrors for home, it not only provides a functional purpose but adds a sophisticated element to any space. Also, the 4 pre-installed reinforced hooks support vertical and horizontal hanging and make it easy to be hung on the wall in 10 minutes DURABLE AND HIGH-QUALITY BATHROOM VANITY MIRROR: Made of UL-LISTED electronic parts and high quality Led Strips, plus the IP44 waterproof and moistureproof aluminum alloy backboard design, ensures this large bathroom mirror safe and durable even in wet environments. The improved packaging will protect the wall mirror well during shipping. If received a damaged mirror, feel free to contact us, and we will offer you a replacement or a full refund","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sL5u4hSES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FRALIMK","source_asin":"B0BG4XD8VB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-359406","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG4XD8VB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG4XD8VB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
