window.products.push({"id":359516,"name":"Eppicotispai Furbo Lids Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NUrOmog2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Eppicotispai FURBO is a system of three patented space-saving flat lids, suitable for any kind of pot, which allows you to store all your lids in less than 2 cm of thickness. But it doesn't simply solve your space problems. With Furbo you don't have to search anymore the right lid for the pot you want to use. In fact it is easy to discover which lid you need among the three Furbo sizes: Small-Medium-Large. You only have to lay it on the pot from one side or from the other side and you will feel it fitting the pot perfectly. In Italian \"Furbo\" means smart. Let's find out why people call it \"Furbo\":- because every Furbo is worth three. One lid for each pot size no more. In fact every Furbo is fit for three different pot sizes (two on one size and one on the other size, by overturning it);- because you only need three FURBO lids for all your pots: from the little pot to the greatest pan (from 5-1/2-inch to 12-inch. because FURBO is space saving The three FURBO lids take less than 3/4-inch of thickness. Therefore you can suit them easily into a drawer or on a shelf of the kitchen cabinets. Or; you can hang them. In the dishwasher they take as much space as one plate. In the refrigerator you can well exploit the room, leaning on a pot a container, a dish or another pot. because it is dish warmer. In fact, while you cook, you can use FURBO to warm foods or keep another pot warm. because it can be used to turn over omelettes. Did you ever realize how easy it becomes with FURBO to turn large omelettes over or to take cakes out of their baking tin? because it is also a trivet and can be used as a tray. because FURBO is safe: it is made of stainless steel 18/10. because FURBO will perfectly last in the long run: its handles are dishwasher-proof and in the long run becomes neither porous nor grey. because with FURBO you buy one lid and you have three.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NUrOmog2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eppicotispai","source_asin":"B0047T6V9E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-359516","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0047T6V9E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0047T6V9E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":359517,"name":"HOMERRY Linen Blend Shower Curtains Rustic Country Button Color Block Fabric Water Resistant Farmhouse Shower Curtain for Bathroom Washable, 72W x 72L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FBVUhs6dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY: Our shower curtain is made of heavy-weight woven linen polyester fabric construction, soft hand feel, durable and thick material. A luxury and spa-like feel is delivered when showering or bathing. ELEGANT & CLASSIC STYLING: The joining together design, uses the color block composition carefully, showing a unique visual fashion. Also, the farmhouse curtain has exquisite brown decorative buttons, adding a simple touch of glamour to the rustic style, a great choice as hotel or home bath tub shower curtains. SERVE WELL: Crafted with premium fabric provides perfect privacy and ensures long-last use and durability. The shower curtain is treated to water resistant and dries quickly. Kindly note-Not total waterproof! GOOD STITCHING: Reinforced top header with 12 rust-resistant metal grommets prevents from tearing and promotes the shower curtain long lasting. Reducing curtain billowing, its weighted hem ensures its longevity and keeps your curtain in place. EASY CARE: Machine washable in cold water, gentle cycle, tumble dry. Cool iron if needed. Each panel measures 72\"W x 72\"L, fits any standard size shower/tub areas and works with straight or curved shower rods.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FBVUhs6dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMERRY","source_asin":"B09NGKJN4V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-359517","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NGKJN4V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NGKJN4V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":359518,"name":"Zen Earth Inspired Tea Organizer Box 7.4\" x 8.1\" x 4.2\" Bamboo Wood Organizer Storage Chest 4 Tall Adjustable Slots 100% Handmade Eco-Friendly Natural","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zHSDB8poL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Big Spacious Compartments - Tea bags come in different shapes and sizes. Our wooden boxes have removable - oversized - slots to fit everything in your tea collection with easy browsing. You can keep loose leaf, matchas, and accessories in the cubbies. Overall dimensions: 7.4\" x 8.1\" x 4.2\" Although our 4-slot boxes are technically the smaller size to our 8-slot boxes, they are still quite big. Safe for you and the Environment - Others use a chemical-based lacquer on their boxes. We use a stain made out of environmentally friendly vegetable oil, keeping the tea safe and smelling good. Natural Wood Material - Durability and sustainability are essential. Our tea box holder is made of solid bamboo. It looks classy and sophisticated because it is 100% handmade with such expertise. Sturdy and Well Designed - The lid features a simple but thoughtfully designed \"TEA\" label. It opens to a 90-degree angle and two heavy-duty metal hinges and a clasp keep it open or closed firmly. Versatile and Adjustable Storage Box - You can store other items in the tea chest, like spices, condiments, or any knick knack. The wooden dividers can be moved and adjusted to fit any item. We are a small woman and family owned businness and we give 1% of profits back to USA based charities.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zHSDB8poL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zen Earth Inspired","source_asin":"B0BPTHBPR9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-359518","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPTHBPR9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPTHBPR9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":359519,"name":"Magnetic Measuring Spoons Set, 8-Piece Stainless Steel Kitchen Measuring Tool for Measuring Dry and Liquid Ingredients, Suitable for Narrow Spice Jars","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nra-m259S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether you are cooking every meal or cooking at home only once a week, your kitchen needs a set of high-quality measuring spoons that can be used consistently. Because the measuring spoon can help you weigh the dry and liquid ingredients of your meal with incredible ease and accuracy. These well-designed spoons will guide you through all your cooking adventures and are a great addition to any modern kitchen！ Strong Madnetic Design : Each of the stainless steel teaspoon measuring spoons have a strong magnetic center allowing for easy and convenient nesting, will not loosen. And they are easy to separate if you only need a teaspoon.Quickly grab the spoon you need without having to fumble with opening and closing. Clear Measurement Marks : All clad measuring cups and spoons stainless steel are on the basis of World Capacity Standard, ML and TSP/TBSP are engraved on the milligram measuring cups and spoons which are clear to read, so you can always get the amount you want when you cooking or baking. Double Head Design : The dual-end design makes it compatible for measuring the powders, liquids and even solids.The round end suitable for liquid. The narrow end designed for reaching jar, so you won't need to shake spices onto the spoon, will save more and waste less of your expensive spices. Package Includes 7 Pcs Measuring spoons: 1x1/8 tsp(0.63 ml) 1x1/4 tsp(1.25 ml) 1x1/2 tsp(2.5 ml) 1x3/4 tsp(3.75 ml) 1x1 tsp(5 ml) 1x1/2 Tbsp(7.5 ml) 1x1 Tbsp(15 ml) 1 Leveler: To remove excess ingredients so that you can cook more accurately and hygienic. Scroll to the top now and click Add to Cart to begin your favorite kitchen experience. Join us and make life better and better.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nra-m259S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KAILEDI","source_asin":"B09WJRS23X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-359519","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WJRS23X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WJRS23X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
