window.products.push({"id":359611,"name":"NOVICA Multicolor Carnaval Scene Folk Art Retablo Wood and Ceramic Wall Mounted Mirror, Little Carnaval'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OE00cTu2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer. About this item: Alejandro Chávez crafts a mirror frame rooted in Andean tradition. Varied scenes represent Carnavalito (Little Carnival), a celebration held in the Peruvian Andes. Musicians play traditional instruments, participants re-enact the birth of Jesus, incredible masks hang on the wall, and a couple stands beneath a towering prickly pear cactus. Known as a retablo, this traditional diorama is housed in a colorful chest crafted of wood and painted. Chávez carefully models each figure from ceramic plaster and paints them by hand. Frame: 11.75\" H x 9.0\" W x 1.4\" D Mirror: 3.3\" W x 6.25\" H - Signed by the artist About our Artist: Andean artisan Alejandro Chavez creates retablos – colorful dioramas unique to the Ayacucho region of Peru. Each tiny figure is shaped and painted by hand, and displayed in a delightful tableau. 'In every one of my works you can find the labors of my wife, who molds the characters, as well as that of my nieces and nephews, whom I currently teach,' he says. The customs and traditions of the Andean people emerge in every retablo.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OE00cTu2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B01M7SC8AN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-359611","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M7SC8AN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M7SC8AN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":359612,"name":"waxinila 72-Branches Faux Tall Pampas Grass, 43'' Artificial Pampas Grass Decor Tall, 18 Branches Large Fluffy Pampas Grass for Floor Vase Floral Arra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iRqgv9C5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ARTIFICIAL FLOWER DECORATION - This is a perfect vase filler to turn a boring vase into a beautiful centerpiece. Creative tall pampas grass for floor vase are suitable for indoor decorations such as living room, bedroom, dining room, kitchen, bathroom, hallway, front room, entrance, and also outdoor decorations such as outdoor weddings, birthday parties, holiday decorations, etc. Set of 4 FAKE PAMPAS GRASS - Each tall pampas grass is about 43 inches and consists of 18 branches. The feathers are made of high quality polyester and the stems are made of wire wrapped in rustic brown paper to give the appearance of dried fall stems. All faux pampas is handmade to ensure every stitch is small and durable. LARGE FLUFFY PAMPAS GRASS - Giant artificial pampas grass is full and soft on every stem. The warm color and fluffy texture of faux pompous grass provides a luxurious natural look and feel. It can be bundled together to create a single lush setting or evenly divided into smaller bundles. You can also create a perfect bundle of several colors. NON-SHEDDING PAMPAS GRASS - The long fibers on each pampas grass decor tall branches are tied securely so they won't shed, fall apart or fade over time. Faux pampas grass decor doesn't become an allergen, it's friendly to your kids and pets. And you can bend the wires to adjust the length of the stems to fit any size vase with no further maintenance to clean. RUSTIC BOHO FLOWERS - Elegant purple pink pampas grass adds the perfect bohemian accent to any venue, such as a chic bohemian modern display for gardens and farmhouses cottages. Perfect for wedding arches, wedding ushers, wreaths, floral arrangements, lifestyle photography, and more. Also perfect for house warming, birthdays or any special occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iRqgv9C5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"waxinila","source_asin":"B0BGXP2D87","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-359612","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGXP2D87","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGXP2D87","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
