window.products.push({"id":359853,"name":"sofani Ruffled Stitched Quilt Set Full/Queen Size(90inchx96inch, White) - Super Soft Lightweight Microfiber Ruffle Bedspread & Coverlet - 3 Pieces(Inc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-34RW2GiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM FINE QUALITY: Our ruffle quilted bedspreads set was made from 100% Microfiber. Compare other offers, 100GSM pre-washed brushed fabric and 130GSM filling make the quilts more soft and durable. In addition, Sofani quilt coverlets has 6 group beautiful ruffled edge detail that would make your room more retro and elegant. SIZES & MEASUREMENTS: The quilt set includes one quilt( 90'' x 96''), two shams( 20'' x 26'') which would fit queen/full size bed. Note: If you want to have the quilt hanging down to both sides of the bed or have an effect shown in the picture, we recommend that you buy a larger quilt or have it on a lower height mattress. MULTI-PURPOSE USAGE: Perfect quilt coverlet for your bedroom, guest room or vacation room. This quilt suitable for summer, spring, autumn/fall season use. In the winter, you could add a comforter or blanket underneath. It is also easy to move freely with this coverlet when you have night sweats or toss and turn a lot. EASY CARE: Machine wash separately on gentle cycle with cold water before first use - No shrinkage, No color fading and No unravelling after every washing. Caution: tumble dry at low temperature, steam if needed, DO NOT iron. WHAT YOU CAN GET: Package includes Sofani 3 pieces white queen size quilt set(1 Quilt & 2 Shams). We offer 30-days return and replacement service & life-time free customer service. If you not satisfied with our products, please contact us immediately with no hesitate. Included components: Pillow Sham","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-34RW2GiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"sofani","source_asin":"B09MMBMPK4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-359853","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MMBMPK4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MMBMPK4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":359854,"name":"Intex Twin Air Mattress with Built in Pump - 18\" Dura-Beam Deluxe Comfort Plush Twin Blow Up Mattress with Wholesalehome Inflatable Pillow for Camping","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hHxO8j9zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Twin Blow Up Mattress with Built In Pump - The right blow up bed is key for a good night's sleep! Whether you're hosting overnight guests, going on an outdoor camping trip, or are in a temporary living situation where you need to use one every day, this air mattress will provide you with luxurious quality sleep. The Air bed can be set up at a moment's notice. Grab the bag where your portable bed is stored, plug the wire into the outlet, turn the dial, and voila! in 2 1/4 minutes you have a fully blown up bed! This air mattress with built in pump will inflate on its own and super fast too. You can choose to put a sheet on. The velvety soft sleeping surface and soft dual-layer comfort top provide a smooth sleeping surface, ensuring utmost comfortability. In addition, you will receive a Wholesalehome travel pillow that is great for camping and on the go! The waterproof flocked top is raised 18\" from the floor. You'll be snoring peacefully and wake up rejuvenated ready for the day ahead! This bed is a great choice, it has all the conveniences you could wish for! Grab this deal and you won't regret it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hHxO8j9zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wholesalehome","source_asin":"B0B6JT1TKZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-359854","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6JT1TKZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6JT1TKZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":359855,"name":"LEBOCADO 16oz Glass Water Bottle with Lid / Leather Protective Sleeve, Wide Mouth Smoothies Cup Leakproof Glass Cups, for Iced Coffee Juices Cocktail ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710OF8pvvpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍸【Large Capacity & Complete Supporting Facilities】Large capacity of 16 oz/450 ml. Enjoy delicious juice or refreshing coffee every day. The set contains 1× 16oz can shaped glasses, 1× matching leather protective sleeve, 1× silicone cup lid. 🍹【High-Quality Materials】LEBOCADO rigorously selects more superior and more transparent food-grade borosilicate glass (BPA-Free, Lead-Free, withstand -68°F to 212°F), which is more thicker than other brands but not bulky. Anti-slip leather sleeve design also protects your hand from temperature burning. Dishwasher safe and easy to clean. 🍸【Leak-Proof Silicone Lid】The glass water bottle uses a newly upgraded silicone sleeve, which is beautiful and practical. This kind of bamboo lid is convenient to use, has stronger sealing performance, and can fits perfectly on top of the cup, preventing liquids from leaking and spilling, while also being easy to clean. Please noted,the lids is not 100% leak-proof,it is only a push-in style lids. 🍹【Wide Mouth Design】Wide mouth smoothie cups owns 3.5” wide opening for easy pouring, the lids fits all wide mouth mason jars. With a wide mouth slot, you can easily put coffee powder, ice cubes, etc. which is also easier to clean later on. 🍸【Portable & Multi-Purpose】Our water glass is 4.7in tall and compact. Portable to carry around in bag or car cup holder, the reusable 16oz glass water bottle can be your go-to everyday mug for travel, on-the-go, school, office, work, shopping, picnic, etc. Perfect for jam, jelly, honey or molasses, honey, cocktails, DIY magnetic spices, canned fruits. Without imprints, you can DIY your unique glass boba cup with cute stickers or decorations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710OF8pvvpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEBOCADO","source_asin":"B09YCZ6ZH7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-359855","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YCZ6ZH7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YCZ6ZH7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
