window.products.push({"id":359973,"name":"Shelf Liner - Heavy Duty Non-Slip, Non-Adhesive Shelf Liner - EVA Material, BPA-Free Plastic – Waterproof, Oil-Proof - Easy to Clean, Wash, Care - Cut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EvsjnhaTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"HIGHEST QUALITY MATERIAL! The Shelf Liner material is of high-quality Ethylene Vinyl Acetate, BPA-free as well as odor free, so you are getting the best shelf liner on the market. This material is also eco-friendly, as it has great waterproof and anti-oil effect. All of our materials are non-adhesive; help reduce slipping and crowding in your drawers. EASY TO INSTALL AND CLEAN! Our shelf-liner can be easily cleaned and wiped off with a simple cloth and water! Because of the simple effort required to clean it makes it reusable as many times as possible. And also, these shelf liners can be moved and adjusted easily with no hassle! Our product also bends, forms into different shapes, and can be used in different placement after washing! Saving you both time and effort as it is top of the line product! SIZE AND DIMENSIONS MAKE IT EASY TO FORM TO ANYTHING! Our product can be cut and shaped into any sizes and designs you'd like! These shelf liners can also be cut ahead of time in the most popular pre-cut sizes for easy installation. For different types of sizes and shapes, you can simply trim the liner with regular scissors you can buy at any hardware store. Simply place the liner in your desired area, and then trim off any excess material. MULTI-PURPOSE AND NON-SLIP! You can use our shelf liners basically anywhere in your home! Whether it's in your kitchen drawers, shelves, cabinets, table tops, dining area, countertops, pantry, office space, or laundry room. These shelf liners are the perfect fit! Additionally, the EVA material will help keep off any dust, dirt, or debris that usually accumulates with other products. These shelf liners are easily washable, reusable, sturdy, durable, and most importantly save your time! U.S.A. Design and Testing: While our products are manufactured overseas (let's be honest, what isn't these days.) ALL our DESIGN AND TESTING was done right here in the United States. Your satisfaction is our #1 priority.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EvsjnhaTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"S SUKIHAR","source_asin":"B083HQZGVR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-359973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083HQZGVR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083HQZGVR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
